# What the Vercel CLI must not upload.
#
# Vercel does NOT read .gitignore when packaging a CLI deploy, so without this
# file `vercel --prod` tries to upload the whole working tree. Here that is
# ~1.9 GB of Flutter build output and Dart tooling, and the upload aborts.
#
# The web app is a Vite build rooted at the repo root; nothing below needs to
# reach the builder.

# ── Flutter app: not part of the web deployment at all ──
ayman_academy_flutter/

# ── Dependencies and build output (the builder produces these itself) ──
node_modules/
dist/

# ── Local tooling and scratch ──
.dart_tool/
.cc-sessions/
designs/
*.apk

# ── Never ship these ──
.env
.env.*
